OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies of babies murdered and
OL,4,Aattacked by Letby hope inquiry creates
OL,5,Achange, lawyer tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe families of seven of Lucy Letby's
OL,8,Fvictims hope that an inquiry into the
OL,9,Fhospital where her crimes took place
OL,10,Fcan "create change", their solicitor
OL,11,Ftells the BBC
OL,13,FTamlin Bolton says on "almost every
OL,14,Fpage" of the Thirlwall Inquiry report
OL,15,Fis "another opportunity where action
OL,16,Fcould have been taken"
OL,18,FThe findings, published on Tuesday,
OL,19,Fsaid there was a "complete failure to
OL,20,Fprotect babies" at the Countess of
OL,21,FChester Hospital - other key findings
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
