OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies of babies murdered and
OL,4,Aattacked by Letby hope inquiry creates
OL,5,Achange, lawyer tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing recommendations from the
OL,8,Finquiry, Health Secretary Yvette Cooper
OL,9,Fsaid the government will "urgently
OL,10,Fdevelop plans" to put live-streaming
OL,11,Fmonitors on cots in neonatal wards in
OL,12,FEngland
OL,14,FMeanwhile, Lib Dem MP Layla Moran tells
OL,15,Fthe BBC a "sea change" is needed in the
OL,16,Fway culture within the NHS is dealt
OL,17,Fwith
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
